{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16606","headline":"寒城晚角 · 朱湾","name":"寒城晚角","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"高台高高画角雄，五更初发寒城中。\n寒城北临大河水，淇门贼烽隔岸是。\n长风送过黎阳川，我军气雄贼心死。\n羇人此夜寐不成，万里边情枕上生。\n乍似陇头戍，寒泉幽咽流不住。\n又如巴江头，啼猨带雨断续愁。\n忽忆嫖姚北征伐，空山宿兵寒对月。\n一声老将起，三奏行人发。\n冀马爲之嘶，朔云爲之结。\n二十年来天下兵，到处不曾无此声。\n洛阳陌，长安路。\n角声朝朝兼暮暮，平居闻之尚难度。\n何况天山征戍儿，云中下营雪里吹。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"朱湾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16606.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16606","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}